---
const points = [
  {
    title: 'Ask in your own words',
    text: 'Type a question about your data, like “Which customers spent the most last month?”. Iara looks at your tables, finds the answer and explains what she found.',
  },
  {
    title: 'You decide what changes',
    text: 'When Iara wants to add a chart or fix a query, she shows the change first. Nothing is saved or run until you press Keep. You can reject it or undo it afterward.',
  },
  {
    title: 'She remembers what you tell her',
    text: 'Tell Iara how you like things done and she will remember next time. Her memories are only yours, and you can read or delete them at any time.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section section--alt" id="assistant">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Meet Iara</span>
      <h2>An assistant that works with your data.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Open Iara next to a notebook or a query. Ask a question, or ask her to write the work for you. She can only
        read what you are allowed to read.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="assistant" data-reveal="scale">
      <div class="chat" aria-label="Example conversation with Iara">
        <p class="chat__you">Add a chart of sales by month.</p>
        <p class="chat__iara">I added it below. The chart uses the orders table and groups the sales by month.</p>
        <div class="proposal">
          <span class="proposal__tag">Iara suggests a change</span>
          <strong>New chart cell</strong>
          <span class="muted small">Sales by month, from the orders table</span>
          <div class="proposal__actions" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="proposal__btn proposal__btn--main">Keep and run</span>
            <span class="proposal__btn">Keep</span>
            <span class="proposal__btn">Reject</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3" data-reveal-stagger>
        {points.map((p) => (
          <article class="card">
            <h3>{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="muted small">{p.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="small muted note" data-reveal>
      Iara runs on an AI service that whoever sets up Studio connects. To answer, her questions, the names of your
      tables and columns, and the results she reads are sent to that service.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .assistant {
    display: grid;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .chat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 560px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--vellum);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .chat p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    max-width: 90%;
  }

  .chat__you {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: var(--cobalt);
    color: var(--vellum);
  }

  .chat__iara {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--parchment-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .proposal {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .proposal__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .proposal__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .proposal__btn {
    padding: 4px 12px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .proposal__btn--main {
    background: var(--cobalt);
    border-color: var(--cobalt);
    color: var(--vellum);
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
</style>
